('9c68c5fd-8bcf-4cc6-b246-ecba3de8ac5d', 'Weighted Backpack Walking', 'Full Body', 'Bodyweight', '{"Full Body"}'::text[], '{}'::text[], 'Elevate your training with this stepping exercise that develops speed, power, and coordination. A versatile bodyweight movement perfect for home or gym training. Plyometric training builds explosive power that transfers to sports and daily activities.', '106761201', '106761201-Weighted-Backpack-Walking-(male)_Plyometrics_.mp4', 'male', FALSE, '2025-12-03 23:26:25.991486+00', '1. Set up in the starting position for Weighted Backpack Walking. 2. Execute the movement with proper form, focusing on your full body. 3. Control both the lifting and lowering phases of the movement. 4. Complete all reps with control before resting.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 3, NULL, 2, 2, NULL, 10, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, 1, NULL, 3, NULL, TRUE, NULL, 'Cardio', 50, 9, 8, FALSE, TRUE, 'walking', 'Weighted Backpack Walking', 'lat_pulldown, bent_over_row, pull_up', FALSE, 'bodyweight', TRUE, 1, 60, 4, 70, 88, 95, 65),
